OL,3,AKyiv bridge hit in further Russian
OL,4,Adrone attack as German chancellor makes
OL,5,Asurprise visit
OL,6,
OL,7,FMajor bridges in Kyiv have been hit by
OL,8,FRussian drone strikes for four
OL,9,Fconsecutive days, as Moscow ramps up
OL,10,Fattacks on critical infrastructure in
OL,11,FUkraine's capital.
OL,13,FTwo people were injured when the
OL,14,FPivnichnyi (Northern) Bridge was struck
OL,15,Fon Sunday morning for the second day in
OL,16,Fa row, while the Pivdennyi (Southern)
OL,17,FBridge was hit multiple times earlier
OL,18,Fin the week.
OL,23,APub: 04-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
