OL,3,AKyiv bridge hit in further Russian
OL,4,Adrone attack as German chancellor makes
OL,5,Asurprise visit
OL,6,
OL,7,FThe latest attack came as German
OL,8,FChancellor Friedrich Merz made a
OL,9,Fsurprise visit to Kyiv in a show of
OL,10,Fsupport against Russia's continuing
OL,11,Ffull-scale invasion.
OL,13,FRussia's military said it would be
OL,14,Fintensifying strikes on Kyiv and other
OL,15,FUkrainian regions. It earlier said it
OL,16,Fhad hit the two bridges used to
OL,17,Ftransfer Ukrainian troops.
OL,23,APub: 04-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG2/2
